AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUMERQVFRUVFRUVFRUV\"\n    \"FRUVFRUVFRUVFRUVFRUVFRUVFRUVFRUVFRUUEQsEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAYKDAsJBAQICgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoKCgoIBAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAkPFBYWEw8IBQoNDg4ODQ0MDhIUExALBQwRFRYWFRUVFBIPCwUAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABCRAUFhYWFA8JAAAAAAAAAAAABg0SFBUVFRUU\"\n    \"FBMRDgkDAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwUGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYGBgYFAwAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AgMDAwMDAwIBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAEDBAQEBAQEAwIBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBAQEAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAgEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMFBQIAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAgQFBgcGAwAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAICAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAwQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAMAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAEBQUDAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAgIAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAMGBwgICAgHBwUDAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBwcEAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAwMBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQFBQUFBQQEAwIAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACBAUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUFBQUF\"\n    \"BQUFBQQBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBgYEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AgQDAQAAAAIFBgYFBQUEAgAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQGBgYEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIFBQUFBQQEAwEAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\"\n    \"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA\";\n\nstatic std::string format_int(int value) {\n    char digits[16];\n    std::size_t count = 0;\n    const bool negative = value < 0;\n    unsigned int magnitude = negative ? static_cast<unsigned int>(-(value + 1)) + 1u : static_cast<unsigned int>(value);\n    do { digits[count++] = static_cast<char>('0' + (magnitude % 10u)); magnitude /= 10u; } while (magnitude != 0u);\n    std::string result;\n    result.reserve(count + (negative ? 1u : 0u));\n    if (negative) result.push_back('-');\n    while (count > 0) result.push_back(digits[--count]);\n    return result;\n}\n\nstatic std::string decode_base64(std::string_view encoded) {\n    auto digit = [](unsigned char c) -> int {\n        if (c >= 'A' && c <= 'Z') return static_cast<int>(c - 'A');\n        if (c >= 'a' && c <= 'z') return static_cast<int>(c - 'a') + 26;\n        if (c >= '0' && c <= '9') return static_cast<int>(c - '0') + 52;\n        if (c == '+') return 62;\n        if (c == '/') return 63;\n        return -1;\n    };\n    std::string decoded;\n    decoded.reserve((encoded.size() / 4u) * 3u);\n    std::uint32_t bits_value = 0;\n    int bit_count = 0;\n    for (unsigned char c : encoded) {\n        if (c == '=') break;\n        const int value = digit(c);\n        if (value < 0) continue;\n        bits_value = (bits_value << 6u) | static_cast<std::uint32_t>(value);\n        bit_count += 6;\n        if (bit_count >= 8) {\n            bit_count -= 8;\n            decoded.push_back(static_cast<char>((bits_value >> bit_count) & 0xffu));\n        }\n    }\n    return decoded;\n}\n\nstruct Mission {\n    const char *title;\n    const char *kind;\n    const char *summary;\n    const char *objects;\n    const char *goal;\n    const char *load;\n    const char *duration;\n    const char *difficulty;\n    int icons[4];\n    bool fault;\n    const char *code;\n};\nstatic const Mission kMissions[] = {\n    Mission{\"Colada de blancos\", \"COLADA\", \"Ropa blanca con suciedad intensa y un calcetín rojo perdido entre las prendas.\", \"Camiseta blanca · sábana · calcetines · calcetín rojo · detergente\", \"Blancos limpios sin desteñir ni dejar barro.\", \"3,2 kg\", \"1 h 45 min\", \"INICIAL\", {1,22,3,6}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Vaqueros y prendas oscuras\", \"COLADA\", \"Vaqueros, camiseta negra y sudadera azul marino; hay prendas blancas mezcladas en la cesta.\", \"Vaqueros · camiseta negra · sudadera · calcetines blancos\", \"Conservar color oscuro y evitar desgaste por calor.\", \"3,8 kg\", \"1 h 20 min\", \"INICIAL\", {2,4,16,18}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Jersey y bufanda de lana\", \"COLADA\", \"Un jersey y una bufanda de lana necesitan un ciclo suave; una toalla no debe entrar.\", \"Jersey · bufanda · toalla · detergente de lana\", \"Evitar apelmazado, encogimiento y torsión de las fibras.\", \"1,4 kg\", \"55 min\", \"INICIAL\", {5,17,6,2}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Ropa deportiva técnica\", \"COLADA\", \"Camisetas de deporte y mallas sintéticas con sudor; se busca retirar olor sin deteriorar fibras.\", \"Camisetas técnicas · mallas · detergente · suavizante\", \"Eliminar sudor y aclarar residuos sin colmatar el tejido.\", \"2,1 kg\", \"1 h 05 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {19,18,16,4}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Ropa de bebé y piel sensible\", \"COLADA\", \"Bodies y sábanas resistentes con manchas; se pide aclarado completo y una dosis sensata.\", \"Bodies claros · sábanas · detergente · filtro de pelusas\", \"Limpiar manchas y minimizar restos de detergente.\", \"3,0 kg\", \"1 h 35 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {21,22,1,6}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Toallas de baño\", \"COLADA\", \"Toallas de algodón húmedas y pesadas, con olor leve; preservar absorción y no exceder la carga.\", \"Toallas de algodón · detergente · tambor\", \"Retirar olor y humedad conservando la absorción del rizo.\", \"4,0 kg\", \"1 h 40 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {6,6,22,1}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Lavado rápido de prendas poco usadas\", \"COLADA\", \"Tres prendas apenas usadas necesitan refrescarse. El ciclo rápido no sirve para una cesta muy sucia.\", \"Camiseta · vaqueros ligeros · dosis de detergente\", \"Ahorrar tiempo sin utilizar el programa rápido fuera de su objetivo.\", \"1,3 kg\", \"20–35 min\", \"INICIAL\", {1,2,16,3}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Sábanas y fundas\", \"COLADA\", \"Ropa de cama de algodón. Hay que dejar espacio para que las piezas grandes se muevan.\", \"Sábanas · fundas · detergente · tambor\", \"Limpiar ropa de cama sin formar una bola que impida el lavado.\", \"4,5 kg\", \"1 h 55 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {22,22,1,6}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Prenda delicada de seda\", \"COLADA\", \"Una blusa y un pañuelo de seda requieren un ciclo delicado y poca fricción.\", \"Blusa de seda · pañuelo de seda · detergente suave · suavizante (no recomendado)\", \"Lavado delicado a 30 °C, sin suavizante y con centrifugado bajo.\", \"0,7 kg\", \"40 min\", \"AVANZADA\", {20,24,7,8}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Ahorro energético Eco\", \"COLADA\", \"Se busca una colada eficiente con la capacidad bien aprovechada, sin sacrificar el resultado.\", \"Algodón compatible · detergente · medidor de carga\", \"Reducir consumo por kilo de ropa y evitar sobrecarga.\", \"5,0 kg\", \"2 h 40 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {1,2,16,22}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Ropa de trabajo con barro\", \"COLADA\", \"Un pantalón resistente y una chaqueta de trabajo llevan barro seco. Retira los sólidos antes del lavado.\", \"Pantalón resistente · chaqueta de trabajo · detergente · toalla de apoyo\", \"Cepillar barro seco, usar prelavado y proteger la bomba.\", \"4,2 kg\", \"2 h 05 min\", \"AVANZADA\", {2,23,7,6}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Prendas nuevas que destiñen\", \"COLADA\", \"Una camiseta nueva de color intenso puede soltar tinte al primer lavado.\", \"Camiseta nueva · ropa de color · toallita atrapacolor\", \"Evitar que el tinte contamine otras prendas.\", \"1,6 kg\", \"50 min\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {16,3,1,22}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Exceso de espuma\", \"AVERÍA\", \"La lavadora deja espuma en la puerta y el aclarado tarda más de lo esperado.\", \"Botella de detergente · cajón · tambor · agua\", \"Eliminar la sobredosis sin abrir filtros de forma insegura.\", \"3,0 kg\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {7,8,0,15}, true, \"ESPUMA\"},\n    Mission{\"No entra agua · E10\", \"AVERÍA\", \"El ciclo empieza pero el tambor no recibe agua. Investiga el suministro antes de desmontar.\", \"Grifo · manguera de entrada · filtro de entrada · enchufe\", \"Revisar el suministro por pasos y solo manipular con seguridad.\", \"Máquina vacía\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {9,10,15,0}, true, \"E10\"},\n    Mission{\"No desagua · E21\", \"AVERÍA\", \"Queda agua en el tambor y la puerta sigue bloqueada. No fuerces la puerta.\", \"Manguera de desagüe · filtro bomba · bandeja · paño\", \"Vaciar y revisar el circuito de desagüe sin inundar el suelo.\", \"Agua residual\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"AVANZADA\", {10,11,15,14}, true, \"E21\"},\n    Mission{\"Vibra y se desplaza · E50\", \"AVERÍA\", \"En el centrifugado la lavadora vibra mucho y se mueve sobre el suelo.\", \"Tornillos de transporte · patas · carga de ropa · nivel\", \"Corregir instalación y distribución sin ejecutar otro centrifugado peligroso.\", \"Carga desequilibrada\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {13,12,2,0}, true, \"E50\"},\n    Mission{\"La puerta no bloquea · E40\", \"AVERÍA\", \"El ciclo no arranca porque la puerta no consigue bloquearse.\", \"Junta de goma · prendas · cierre · panel de control\", \"Comprobar obstáculos y cierre sin forzar el mecanismo.\", \"Puerta sin bloquear\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {0,1,14,15}, true, \"E40\"},\n    Mission{\"No centrifuga\", \"AVERÍA\", \"El lavado termina pero la ropa sale empapada; hay que descartar causas sencillas.\", \"Carga · filtro bomba · manguera de desagüe · selector\", \"Distinguir desequilibrio de carga de problemas de desagüe.\", \"Ropa empapada\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"INTERMEDIA\", {2,10,11,0}, true, \"CENTRIFUGADO\"},\n    Mission{\"Mal olor y residuos\", \"MANTENIMIENTO\", \"El tambor y la junta desprenden olor; el cajón acumula restos de detergente.\", \"Junta · cajón · tambor · paño · producto de limpieza apto\", \"Limpiar zonas accesibles y cambiar hábitos de ventilación.\", \"Sin carga\", \"Mantenimiento\", \"INICIAL\", {0,7,15,8}, true, \"MANTENIMIENTO\"},\n    Mission{\"Fuga de agua\", \"AVERÍA\", \"Aparece agua junto a la lavadora. La prioridad es evitar el contacto con electricidad y cortar el suministro.\", \"Grifo · manguera · junta · enchufe · paños\", \"Proteger a las personas y contener la fuga antes de buscar origen.\", \"Fuga visible\", \"Seguridad\", \"AVANZADA\", {9,10,14,15}, true, \"FUGA\"},\n};\n\nstatic const Mission kExpertMissions[kExpertMissionCount] = {\n    Mission{\"P-2 · Blancos muy sucios\", \"EXPERTO\", \"LOGI PRO P-2: 56 min y 7 fases. Prepara una carga nominal homogénea de blancos compatibles y comprueba el equilibrio.\", \"Camiseta blanca · sábana · toalla · body blanco\", \"P-2 a 40 °C, detergente principal en II y carga equilibrada.\", \"Carga blanca nominal\", \"56 min · 7 fases\", \"EXPERTO\", {1,22,6,21}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"P-7 · Sintéticos\", \"EXPERTO\", \"LOGI PRO P-7: 30 min y 5 fases. Prepara una carga parcial homogénea con prendas sintéticas y centrifugado moderado.\", \"Camiseta técnica · mallas deportivas · camiseta azul marino · camiseta oscura\", \"P-7 a 30 °C; el límite de 800 rpm es una regla didáctica de la simulación.\", \"80–90 % nominal\", \"30 min · 5 fases\", \"EXPERTO\", {19,18,16,4}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"P-1 · Suciedad extrema\", \"EXPERTO\", \"LOGI PRO P-1: 66 min y 8 fases. La tabla incluye una fase a 80 °C, pero las etiquetas de esta carga limitan el ajuste a 30 °C; activa el prelavado y separa las dosis I y II.\", \"Chaqueta de trabajo · vaqueros · mallas resistentes · camiseta oscura\", \"P-1 a 30 °C, con prelavado y dosis I + II; respeta el máximo de las etiquetas.\", \"Carga resistente homogénea\", \"66 min · 8 fases\", \"EXPERTO\", {23,2,18,4}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"P-8 · Lana y delicados\", \"EXPERTO\", \"LOGI PRO P-8: 31 min y 5 fases. Usa una carga pequeña, acción suave y ningún suavizante; confirma el cuidado de cada prenda.\", \"Jersey de lana · bufanda de lana · blusa de seda · pañuelo de seda\", \"P-8 a 30 °C, máximo didáctico de 600 rpm, dos prendas y sin suavizante.\", \"35–50 % nominal\", \"31 min · 5 fases\", \"EXPERTO\", {5,17,20,24}, false, \"\"},\n    Mission{\"Desequilibrio antes de centrifugar\", \"EXPERTO\", \"El manual describe el control de desequilibrio en modelos HS. Redistribuye dos prendas homogéneas antes de activar la centrifuga.\", \"Dos toallas iguales · acceso a la zona técnica\", \"Equilibra el tambor, selecciona Centrifugar y deja desactivada toda dosificación.\", \"2 toallas iguales\", \"Diagnóstico\", \"EXPERTO\", {6,6,6,6}, false, \"\"}\n};\n\nstruct WashRule {\n    int program;\n    int target_temp;\n    int max_spin;\n    unsigned int required_items;\n    bool prewash;\n    bool extra_rinse;\n    bool no_softener;\n    bool brush_before_wash;\n    bool requires_main_dose = true;\n    bool require_balance = false;\n    bool no_detergent = false;\n};\n// Programs: Cotton, Synthetics, Delicates, Wool, Quick, Rinse, Spin, Eco.\nstatic constexpr WashRule kWashRules[] = {\n    {0, 40, 1000, 0x3u, true,  false, false, false},\n    {1, 30,  800, 0x3u, false, false, false, false},\n    {3, 30,  600, 0x1u, false, false, true,  false},\n    {1, 30,  800, 0x3u, false, false, true,  false},\n    {0, 40,  800, 0x3u, false, true,  false, false},\n    {0, 60, 1000, 0x3u, false, false, false, false},\n    {4, 30,  800, 0x3u, false, false, false, false},\n    {0, 40,  800, 0x3u, false, false, false, false},\n    {2, 30,  400, 0x3u, false, false, true,  false},\n    {7, 30,  800, 0x7u, false, false, false, false},\n    {0, 30, 1000, 0x3u, true,  false, false, true },\n    {1, 30,  800, 0x1u, false, false, false, false},\n};\nstatic constexpr WashRule kExpertWashRules[kExpertMissionCount] = {\n    {1, 40, 1000, 0xFu, false, false, false, false, true,  true,  false},\n    {6, 30,  800, 0x7u, false, false, false, false, true,  true,  false},\n    {0, 30, 1000, 0xFu, true,  false, false, false, true,  true,  false},\n    {7, 30,  600, 0x3u, false, false, true,  false, true,  false, false},\n    {6,  0, 1000, 0x3u, false, false, true,  false, false, true,  true}\n};\n\nstatic constexpr int kBasketIcons[kMissionCount][4] = {\n    {1,22,3,6}, {2,4,16,18}, {5,17,6,2}, {19,18,16,4}, {21,22,1,6},\n    {6,6,22,1}, {1,2,16,3}, {22,22,1,6}, {20,24,7,8}, {1,2,16,22},\n    {2,23,7,6}, {16,3,1,22}, {1,6,4,2}, {1,2,6,4}, {1,6,2,4},\n    {2,4,1,6}, {1,4,2,6}, {2,4,6,1}, {1,6,2,4}, {1,2,6,4}\n};\nstatic constexpr int kDefaultTemp[8] = {40,30,30,30,30,0,0,40};\nstatic constexpr int kDefaultSpin[8] = {1000,800,400,600,800,800,1000,800};\nstatic constexpr const char *kTexturePaths[kIconCount] = {\n    \"ps5hs/asset-machine.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-white-shirt.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-jeans.rgba\",\n    \"ps5hs/asset-red-sock.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-dark-shirt.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-wool-sweater.rgba\",\n    \"ps5hs/asset-towel.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-detergent.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-softener.rgba\",\n    \"ps5hs/asset-tap.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-drain-hose.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-pump-filter.rgba\",\n    \"ps5hs/asset-level-foot.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-transit-bolt.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-power-plug.rgba\",\n    \"ps5hs/asset-water-drop.rgba\", \"ps5hs/asset-simulation-alarm-atlas.rgba\"\n};\n\nstatic constexpr const char *kUtilityTextureLabels[8][9] = {\n    {\"Detergente\", \"Suavizante\", \"Grifo\", \"Manguera de desagüe\", \"Filtro de bomba\", \"Pata niveladora\", \"Tornillo de transporte\", \"Enchufe\", \"Gota de agua\"},\n    {\"Detergent\", \"Softener\", \"Water tap\", \"Drain hose\", \"Pump filter\", \"Leveling foot\", \"Transit bolt\", \"Power plug\", \"Water drop\"},\n    {\"Lessive\", \"Assouplissant\", \"Robinet\", \"Tuyau de vidange\", \"Filtre de pompe\", \"Pied réglable\", \"Bride de transport\", \"Prise\", \"Goutte d’eau\"},\n    {\"Моющее средство\", \"Кондиционер\", \"Кран\", \"Сливной шланг\", \"Фильтр насоса\", \"Регулируемая ножка\", \"Транспортировочный болт\", \"Вилка\", \"Капля воды\"},\n    {\"Waschmittel\", \"Weichspüler\", \"Wasserhahn\", \"Ablaufschlauch\", \"Pumpenfilter\", \"Stellfuß\", \"Transportschraube\", \"Netzstecker\", \"Wassertropfen\"},\n    {\"洗剤\", \"柔軟剤\", \"蛇口\", \"排水ホース\", \"ポンプフィルター\", \"調整脚\", \"輸送用ボルト\", \"電源プラグ\", \"水滴\"},\n    {\"洗涤剂\", \"柔顺剂\", \"水龙头\", \"排水管\", \"泵过滤器\", \"调平支脚\", \"运输螺栓\", \"电源插头\", \"水滴\"},\n    {\"Detersivo\", \"Ammorbidente\", \"Rubinetto\", \"Tubo di scarico\", \"Filtro pompa\", \"Piedino regolabile\", \"Bullone di trasporto\", \"Spina\", \"Goccia d’acqua\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kAdditionalTextureLabels[8][9] = {\n    {\"Camiseta azul marino\", \"Bufanda de lana\", \"Mallas deportivas\", \"Camiseta técnica\", \"Blusa de seda\", \"Body de bebé\", \"Sábanas y fundas\", \"Chaqueta de trabajo\", \"Pañuelo de seda\"},\n    {\"Navy T-shirt\", \"Wool scarf\", \"Sports leggings\", \"Technical sports shirt\", \"Silk blouse\", \"Baby bodysuit\", \"Bed linen\", \"Work jacket\", \"Silk scarf\"},\n    {\"T-shirt bleu marine\", \"Écharpe en laine\", \"Legging de sport\", \"T-shirt technique\", \"Chemisier en soie\", \"Body de bébé\", \"Draps et taies\", \"Veste de travail\", \"Foulard en soie\"},\n    {\"Тёмно-синяя футболка\", \"Шерстяной шарф\", \"Спортивные легинсы\", \"Спортивная футболка\", \"Шёлковая блузка\", \"Боди для малыша\", \"Постельное бельё\", \"Рабочая куртка\", \"Шёлковый шарф\"},\n    {\"Marineblaues T-Shirt\", \"Wollschal\", \"Sportleggings\", \"Funktionsshirt\", \"Seidenbluse\", \"Babybody\", \"Bettwäsche\", \"Arbeitsjacke\", \"Seidenschal\"},\n    {\"紺色のTシャツ\", \"ウールのマフラー\", \"スポーツレギンス\", \"スポーツ用機能性シャツ\", \"シルクのブラウス\", \"ベビー用ロンパース\", \"シーツと枕カバー\", \"作業用ジャケット\", \"シルクのスカーフ\"},\n    {\"藏青色T恤\", \"羊毛围巾\", \"运动紧身裤\", \"功能运动衫\", \"真丝衬衫\", \"婴儿连体衣\", \"床单和枕套\", \"工作夹克\", \"真丝围巾\"},\n    {\"Maglietta blu navy\", \"Sciarpa di lana\", \"Leggings sportivi\", \"Maglia tecnica\", \"Camicetta di seta\", \"Body neonato\", \"Lenzuola e federe\", \"Giacca da lavoro\", \"Sciarpa di seta\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareTitle[8] = {\"ETIQUETA DE CUIDADO\", \"GARMENT CARE LABEL\", \"ÉTIQUETTE D’ENTRETIEN\", \"ЯРЛЫК УХОДА\", \"PFLEGEETIKETT\", \"洗濯表示\", \"洗涤护理标签\", \"ETICHETTA DI CURA\"};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareDisclaimer[8] = {\"Ficha didáctica de referencia. La etiqueta cosida de la prenda real siempre prevalece.\", \"Educational example only. Always follow the sewn-in care label on the actual garment.\", \"Exemple pédagogique. L’étiquette cousue du vêtement réel fait toujours foi.\", \"Учебный пример. Всегда следуйте ярлыку на самой вещи.\", \"Didaktisches Beispiel. Maßgeblich ist immer das eingenähte Etikett des Kleidungsstücks.\", \"教材用の参考情報です。実際の衣類に縫い付けられた洗濯表示を必ず優先してください。\", \"本内容仅供学习参考。实际衣物上的缝制护理标签始终优先。\", \"Esempio didattico. Fa sempre fede l’etichetta cucita sul capo reale.\"};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareFieldLabels[8][6] = {\n    {\"Lavado\", \"Blanqueo\", \"Secadora\", \"Planchado\", \"Secado natural\", \"Cuidado profesional\"},\n    {\"Washing\", \"Bleaching\", \"Tumble drying\", \"Ironing\", \"Natural drying\", \"Professional care\"},\n    {\"Lavage\", \"Blanchiment\", \"Sèche-linge\", \"Repassage\", \"Séchage naturel\", \"Entretien professionnel\"},\n    {\"Стирка\", \"Отбеливание\", \"Сушильная машина\", \"Глажение\", \"Естественная сушка\", \"Профессиональный уход\"},\n    {\"Waschen\", \"Bleichen\", \"Trockner\", \"Bügeln\", \"Lufttrocknen\", \"Professionelle Pflege\"},\n    {\"洗濯\", \"漂白\", \"タンブル乾燥\", \"アイロン\", \"自然乾燥\", \"専門クリーニング\"},\n    {\"洗涤\", \"漂白\", \"滚筒烘干\", \"熨烫\", \"自然晾干\", \"专业护理\"},\n    {\"Lavaggio\", \"Candeggio\", \"Asciugatrice\", \"Stiratura\", \"Asciugatura naturale\", \"Cura professionale\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareWashModes[8][5] = {\n    {\"Algodón normal\", \"Colores / lavar del revés\", \"Lana: muy delicado\", \"Sintéticos: delicado\", \"Seda: lavado delicado\"},\n    {\"Normal cotton\", \"Colours / inside out\", \"Wool: very gentle\", \"Synthetics: gentle\", \"Silk: delicates\"},\n    {\"Coton normal\", \"Couleurs / sur l’envers\", \"Laine : très doux\", \"Synthétiques : doux\", \"Soie : délicats\"},\n    {\"Хлопок, обычный\", \"Цветное / наизнанку\", \"Шерсть: очень бережно\", \"Синтетика: бережно\", \"Шёлк: деликатно\"},\n    {\"Baumwolle normal\", \"Buntwäsche / links\", \"Wolle: sehr schonend\", \"Synthetik: schonend\", \"Seide: Feinwäsche\"},\n    {\"標準コース（綿）\", \"色物／裏返して洗う\", \"ウール：非常に弱い洗い\", \"化繊：弱い洗い\", \"シルク：デリケート\"},\n    {\"棉织物标准洗\", \"彩色衣物／翻面洗\", \"羊毛：极轻柔\", \"化纤：轻柔\", \"真丝：轻柔\"},\n    {\"Cotone normale\", \"Colorati / al rovescio\", \"Lana: molto delicato\", \"Sintetici: delicato\", \"Seta: delicati\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareBleach[8][3] = {\n    {\"No usar lejía\", \"Solo oxígeno, sin cloro\", \"Según etiqueta\"},\n    {\"Do not bleach\", \"Oxygen / non-chlorine only\", \"Follow the garment label\"},\n    {\"Ne pas blanchir\", \"Oxygène sans chlore seulement\", \"Suivre l’étiquette\"},\n    {\"Не отбеливать\", \"Только кислородный отбеливатель\", \"По ярлыку\"},\n    {\"Nicht bleichen\", \"Nur Sauerstoffbleiche\", \"Etikett beachten\"},\n    {\"漂白剤不可\", \"酸素系のみ（塩素系不可）\", \"洗濯表示に従う\"},\n    {\"不可漂白\", \"仅可使用氧系漂白剂\", \"遵循衣物护理标签\"},\n    {\"Non candeggiare\", \"Solo ossigeno senza cloro\", \"Seguire l’etichetta\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareTumble[8][3] = {\n    {\"No usar secadora\", \"Temperatura baja\", \"Temperatura normal\"},\n    {\"Do not tumble dry\", \"Low temperature\", \"Normal temperature\"},\n    {\"Pas de sèche-linge\", \"Basse température\", \"Température normale\"},\n    {\"Не сушить в машине\", \"Низкая температура\", \"Обычная температура\"},\n    {\"Nicht im Trockner\", \"Niedrige Temperatur\", \"Normale Temperatur\"},\n    {\"タンブル乾燥不可\", \"低温\", \"通常温度\"},\n    {\"不可滚筒烘干\", \"低温\", \"常温\"},\n    {\"Non usare asciugatrice\", \"Bassa temperatura\", \"Temperatura normale\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareIron[8][4] = {\n    {\"No planchar\", \"Baja: máx. 110 °C\", \"Media: máx. 150 °C\", \"Alta: máx. 200 °C\"},\n    {\"Do not iron\", \"Low: max 110 °C\", \"Medium: max 150 °C\", \"High: max 200 °C\"},\n    {\"Ne pas repasser\", \"Basse : max. 110 °C\", \"Moyenne : max. 150 °C\", \"Élevée : max. 200 °C\"},\n    {\"Не гладить\", \"Низкая: макс. 110 °C\", \"Средняя: макс. 150 °C\", \"Высокая: макс. 200 °C\"},\n    {\"Nicht bügeln\", \"Niedrig: max. 110 °C\", \"Mittel: max. 150 °C\", \"Hoch: max. 200 °C\"},\n    {\"アイロン不可\", \"低温：最高110 °C\", \"中温：最高150 °C\", \"高温：最高200 °C\"},\n    {\"不可熨烫\", \"低温：最高110 °C\", \"中温：最高150 °C\", \"高温：最高200 °C\"},\n    {\"Non stirare\", \"Bassa: max 110 °C\", \"Media: max 150 °C\", \"Alta: max 200 °C\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareDry[8][3] = {\n    {\"Secar en horizontal\", \"Tender a la sombra\", \"Tender en línea\"},\n    {\"Dry flat\", \"Line dry in shade\", \"Line dry\"},\n    {\"Sécher à plat\", \"Sécher à l’ombre sur fil\", \"Sécher sur fil\"},\n    {\"Сушить горизонтально\", \"Сушить в тени на верёвке\", \"Сушить на верёвке\"},\n    {\"Liegend trocknen\", \"Im Schatten aufhängen\", \"Auf der Leine trocknen\"},\n    {\"平干し\", \"日陰で吊り干し\", \"吊り干し\"},\n    {\"平摊晾干\", \"阴凉处悬挂晾干\", \"悬挂晾干\"},\n    {\"Asciugare in piano\", \"Stendere all’ombra\", \"Stendere in linea\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareProfessional[8][3] = {\n    {\"No indicada\", \"Consultar etiqueta\", \"Limpieza profesional si la etiqueta lo permite\"},\n    {\"Not indicated\", \"Check the garment label\", \"Professional cleaning if the label permits\"},\n    {\"Non indiquée\", \"Voir l’étiquette\", \"Nettoyage professionnel si autorisé\"},\n    {\"Не требуется\", \"Проверьте ярлык\", \"Профчистка, если разрешена ярлыком\"},\n    {\"Nicht angegeben\", \"Etikett prüfen\", \"Professionelle Reinigung, wenn erlaubt\"},\n    {\"指定なし\", \"洗濯表示を確認\", \"表示が許可する場合のみ専門クリーニング\"},\n    {\"未指定\", \"查看护理标签\", \"仅在标签允许时进行专业清洁\"},\n    {\"Non indicata\", \"Controllare l’etichetta\", \"Pulizia professionale se consentita\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareMaterials[8][7] = {\n    {\"Algodón\", \"Denim / algodón con elastano\", \"Lana\", \"Poliéster técnico / elastano\", \"Seda\", \"Algodón de ropa de cama y bebé\", \"Algodón grueso / lona de trabajo\"},\n    {\"Cotton\", \"Denim / cotton elastane\", \"Wool\", \"Technical polyester / elastane\", \"Silk\", \"Cotton for bedding and babywear\", \"Heavy cotton / workwear canvas\"},\n    {\"Coton\", \"Denim / coton élasthanne\", \"Laine\", \"Polyester technique / élasthanne\", \"Soie\", \"Coton pour linge de lit et bébé\", \"Coton épais / toile de travail\"},\n    {\"Хлопок\", \"Деним / хлопок с эластаном\", \"Шерсть\", \"Технический полиэстер / эластан\", \"Шёлк\", \"Хлопок для белья и детской одежды\", \"Плотный хлопок / рабочая ткань\"},\n    {\"Baumwolle\", \"Denim / Baumwolle-Elastan\", \"Wolle\", \"Funktionspolyester / Elastan\", \"Seide\", \"Baumwolle für Bettwäsche und Babykleidung\", \"Schwere Baumwolle / Arbeitscanvas\"},\n    {\"綿\", \"デニム／綿・エラスタン\", \"ウール\", \"機能性ポリエステル／エラスタン\", \"シルク\", \"寝具・ベビー用綿\", \"厚手綿／作業着用キャンバス\"},\n    {\"棉\", \"牛仔布／棉与氨纶\", \"羊毛\", \"功能聚酯纤维／氨纶\", \"真丝\", \"床品和婴儿衣物用棉\", \"厚棉布／工装帆布\"},\n    {\"Cotone\", \"Denim / cotone elasticizzato\", \"Lana\", \"Poliestere tecnico / elastan\", \"Seta\", \"Cotone per biancheria e neonati\", \"Cotone pesante / tela da lavoro\"}\n};\nstatic constexpr const char *kCareNotes[8][8] = {\n    {\"Separa por color; no laves el blanco con prendas que destiñan.\", \"Lavar del revés con colores similares.\", \"Secar en horizontal y no retorcer.\", \"Evita el suavizante: puede reducir el rendimiento técnico.\", \"Usa detergente suave y bolsa de lavado si la etiqueta lo permite.\", \"Para piel sensible, dosifica bien y aclara a fondo.\", \"Las piezas grandes necesitan espacio para moverse.\", \"Cepilla el barro seco y lava la ropa de trabajo por separado si lo indica su etiqueta.\"},\n    {\"Separate by colour; keep whites away from colour-bleeding garments.\", \"Wash inside out with similar colours.\", \"Dry flat; do not wring.\", \"Avoid softener; it can reduce technical performance.\", \"Use mild detergent and a wash bag if the garment label permits.\", \"For sensitive skin, dose carefully and rinse thoroughly.\", \"Large pieces need room to move.\", \"Brush off dried mud and wash workwear separately when its care label requires it.\"},\n    {\"Séparer les couleurs ; éloigner le blanc des vêtements qui déteignent.\", \"Laver sur l’envers avec des couleurs similaires.\", \"Sécher à plat sans tordre.\", \"Éviter l’assouplissant, qui peut réduire les performances techniques.\", \"Lessive douce et filet si l’étiquette l’autorise.\", \"Pour les peaux sensibles, doser avec soin et bien rincer.\", \"Les grandes pièces ont besoin d’espace.\", \"Brosser la boue sèche et laver séparément si l’étiquette du vêtement de travail le demande.\"},\n    {\"Сортируйте по цвету; белое стирайте отдельно от линяющих вещей.\", \"Стирать наизнанку с похожими цветами.\", \"Сушить горизонтально, не выкручивать.\", \"Не использовать кондиционер: он может ухудшить свойства ткани.\", \"Мягкое средство и мешок для стирки, если разрешено ярлыком.\", \"Для чувствительной кожи точно дозируйте средство и хорошо полощите.\", \"Крупным вещам нужно пространство.\", \"Удалите сухую грязь щёткой; стирайте рабочую одежду отдельно, если этого требует ярлык.\"},\n    {\"Nach Farbe sortieren; Weißes von abfärbenden Teilen trennen.\", \"Mit ähnlichen Farben auf links waschen.\", \"Liegend trocknen und nicht wringen.\", \"Keinen Weichspüler verwenden; er kann Funktionsfasern beeinträchtigen.\", \"Mildes Waschmittel und Wäschenetz, wenn das Etikett es erlaubt.\", \"Für empfindliche Haut richtig dosieren und gründlich spülen.\", \"Große Wäschestücke brauchen Bewegungsfreiheit.\", \"Getrockneten Schlamm abbürsten und Arbeitskleidung nach Pflegeetikett separat waschen.\"},\n    {\"色別に分け、色移りする衣類と白物を分けてください。\", \"似た色の衣類と裏返して洗います。\", \"平干しにし、ねじって絞らないでください。\", \"柔軟剤は機能性を損なう場合があるため避けてください。\", \"表示で許可されている場合は中性洗剤と洗濯ネットを使います。\", \"敏感肌向けには適量を守り、十分にすすいでください。\", \"大きな布類には動くための余裕が必要です。\", \"乾いた泥をブラシで落とし、表示に従って作業着を別洗いします。\"},\n    {\"按颜色分类；白色衣物要与易掉色衣物分开。\", \"与相近颜色衣物一起洗，洗前翻至反面。\", \"平铺晾干，不要拧绞。\", \"柔顺剂可能降低功能面料的性能，应避免使用。\", \"护理标签允许时，使用温和洗涤剂和洗衣袋。\", \"敏感肌衣物应准确用量并充分漂洗。\", \"大件织物需要足够的活动空间。\", \"刷掉干泥；若护理标签要求，应将工装分开洗涤。\"},\n    {\"Separa per colore; tieni il bianco lontano dai capi che stingono.\", \"Lavare al rovescio con colori simili.\", \"Asciugare in piano senza strizzare.\", \"Evita l’ammorbidente: può ridurre le prestazioni tecniche.\", \"Detersivo delicato e sacchetto se l’etichetta lo consente.\", \"Per la pelle sensibile, dosa bene e risciacqua a fondo.\", \"I capi grandi hanno bisogno di spazio.\", \"Spazzola il fango secco e lava separatamente gli indumenti da lavoro se lo richiede l’etichetta.\"}\n};\nstruct GarmentCareSpec { int texture; int temp; int wash; int bleach; int tumble; int iron; int dry; int professional; int material; int note; };\nstatic constexpr GarmentCareSpec kGarmentCare[] = {\n    {1,40,0,1,1,2,2,0,0,0}, {2,30,1,0,0,2,1,0,1,1}, {3,40,0,0,1,1,2,0,0,0},\n    {4,30,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1}, {5,30,2,0,0,1,0,1,2,2}, {6,60,0,1,1,2,2,0,0,0},\n    {16,30,1,0,1,1,1,0,0,1}, {17,30,2,0,0,1,0,1,2,2}, {18,30,3,0,0,1,1,0,3,3},\n    {19,30,3,0,0,1,1,0,3,3}, {20,30,4,0,0,1,0,2,4,4}, {21,40,0,1,1,2,2,0,5,5},\n    {22,60,0,1,2,2,2,0,5,6}, {23,40,0,0,1,2,2,0,6,7}, {24,30,4,0,0,1,1,2,4,4}\n};\nstatic const GarmentCareSpec *garment_care_spec(int texture) {\n    for (const auto &spec : kGarmentCare) if (spec.texture == texture) return &spec;\n    return nullptr;\n}\nstatic int rendered_language(int language) { return std::max(0, std::min(language, 7)); }\n\nstatic const char *localized_texture_label(int texture, int mission, int slot, int language);\n\nenum class Screen { title, missions, play, result, simulation, manual, settings, saves, confirm_delete, confirm_new_game };\nenum class Direction { none, up, down, left, right };\nenum class SimulationFault : std::uint8_t { inlet, drain, imbalance, door, leak };\nenum class SimText : std::size_t { mode, title, intro, model, start, manual, case_prefix, alarm_heading, alarm_active, alarm_cleared, manual_required, manual_read, manual_unread, result_title, result_repaired, result_contained, new_case, back, spill_label, spill_safety, spill_done, no_hints, point_count, count };\nstruct FocusNode { int id; float x; float y; };\n\nenum class UiText : std::size_t { app_tagline, title_subtitle, title_intro, title_menu, continue_game, new_game, save_data, settings_title, manual, manual_heading, manual_section, manual_change_page, manual_close, hint_short, open_technical_zone, resume_mission, new_game_desc, save_prompt, settings_desc, saves_title, save_slot, slot_saved, slot_empty, saved_progress, save_now, load_game, delete_save, save_success, save_failed, load_success, load_failed, delete_success, delete_failed, confirm_delete, confirm_newgame, confirm_warning, yes, cancel, settings_reset, reset_settings, language, effects_volume, brightness, ui_scale_option, ui_scale_badge, autosave, on, off, ui_scale_description, audio_note, font_note, navigate, select, back, progress, mission_hub, free_play, next_mission, mission_unlock_hint, completed, start_mission, mission_locked, unlock_all, unlock_all_desc, no_progress, washer, ready_to_use, stage_waiting, stage_filling, stage_prewash, stage_washing, stage_rinsing, stage_draining, stage_spinning, basket_title, basket_instructions, load_current, in_drum, in_basket, diagnostic_title, wash_objective, objects, load_label, time_label, goal_