TIME\", \"GOAL\", \"NEXT STEP\", \"1. Load laundry and close the door\", \"1. Open the door to load or remove items\", \"2. Turn the washer on\", \"2. Check the program and settings\", \"3. The drum is washing\", \"3. Press Start when everything is ready\", \"II is the main wash. I is only for prewash. Avoid overdosing; follow the label and water hardness.\", \"START WASH\", \"CYCLE RUNNING\", \"Drawer open. Choose I, II or softener.\", \"Drawer closed.\", \"Prewash detergent in I.\", \"Main-wash detergent in II.\", \"Softener added.\", \"Softener switched off.\", \"Washer powered on.\", \"Washer powered off.\", \"DOOR OPEN\", \"DOOR CLOSED\", \"EMPTY DRUM\", \"TECHNICAL ZONE · DIAGNOSTICS & MAINTENANCE\", \"Safety: switch off and unplug before repairs; never handle plugs near water.\", \"Select a point and press X to inspect or repair it.\", \"14 CHECKPOINTS\", \"Power plug\", \"Water tap\", \"Inlet hose\", \"Inlet filter\", \"Drain hose\", \"Water tray\", \"Pump filter\", \"Leveling feet\", \"Transit bolts\", \"Load balance\", \"Door lock\", \"Detergent drawer\", \"Door gasket\", \"Dried mud\", \"CONNECTED\", \"DISCONNECTED\", \"OPEN\", \"CLOSED\", \"STRAIGHT\", \"KINKED\", \"CLEAN\", \"DIRTY\", \"BLOCKED\", \"IN PLACE\", \"MISSING TRAY\", \"LEVEL\", \"UNLEVEL\", \"REMOVED\", \"INSTALLED\", \"BALANCED\", \"UNBALANCED\", \"CLEAR\", \"OBSTRUCTED\", \"RESIDUE\", \"DRIED MUD\", \"BRUSHED\", \"MISSION\", \"MISSION COMPLETE\", \"LAUNDRY\", \"DIAGNOSTIC\", \"MISSION\", \"OBJECTIVE\", \"PROGRAM\", \"RETURN TO MISSIONS\", \"POINTS\", \"STARS\", \"OFF\", \"READY\", \"TEMP.\", \"Adjust\", \"Accept\", \"Interact\", \"Select the next available mission.\", \"Drawer open. Choose I, II or softener.\", \"Drawer closed.\", \"Prewash detergent added to I.\", \"Compartment I is empty.\", \"Main-wash detergent added to II.\", \"Compartment II is empty.\", \"Softener dosed.\", \"Softener disabled.\", \"Do not switch off while the drum is moving.\", \"Washer switched on.\", \"Washer switched off.\", \"Programme dial active: move the stick left or right.\", \"Temperature active: adjust to match the care label.\", \"Spin active: adjust the rpm.\", \"Prewash enabled: use detergent in compartment I.\", \"Prewash disabled.\", \"Extra rinse enabled.\", \"Extra rinse disabled.\", \"Service area opened. Follow the safety steps.\", \"Service area opened. Switch off and unplug before touching connections.\", \"Service area closed.\", \"Water tap opened.\", \"Water tap closed.\", \"Tray placed under the filter.\", \"Tray removed.\", \"Do not handle laundry during a cycle.\", \"Open the door before loading or removing items.\", \"Drum is full. Do not force more items in.\", \"Door locked for safety. Resolve the water issue or wait for the cycle.\", \"An item blocks the latch. Remove the obstruction in the service area before closing.\", \"Door closed.\", \"Door open. You can load or redistribute the laundry.\", \"Do not touch the plug on a wet floor. Switch off and close the tap without approaching the water.\", \"Do not disconnect power during a cycle.\", \"Power plug connected.\", \"Unplugged. You can now work on hoses and filters.\", \"Safety: switch off and unplug before handling a hose.\", \"Inlet hose is straight and not kinked.\", \"Drain hose is straight and clear.\", \"Close the tap, switch off and unplug before cleaning the inlet filter.\", \"Inlet filter cleaned. You can reopen the tap when finished.\", \"Switch off and unplug before opening the pump filter.\", \"Place a tray first; residual water may spill out.\", \"Filter opened slowly. Interact again to remove the blockage.\", \"Blockage removed and water caught in the tray.\", \"Filter fully closed; reconnect only when everything is dry.\", \"Switch off and unplug before adjusting the feet.\", \"Feet levelled. The washer stands without rocking.\", \"Switch off and unplug before removing transit bolts.\", \"Transit bolts removed.\", \"Switch off and open the door before redistributing the load.\